  "rationale": "Keep Puget Energy, Inc. as the single canonical manager-level platform and retire Puget Sound Energy as a duplicate PortCo record. Puget Holdings owns Puget Energy, which owns 100% of regulated utility PSE and also owns Puget LNG; PSE therefore remains a subsidiary and operating brand, not a second portfolio company. The six current Puget Holdings investors and two former investor periods are preserved once, using the current 2026 disclosed stakes and verified transition dates.",
